## 🔹 GitLab CI — Parameterized via Variables
You will learn how to **use variables to parameterize GitLab jobs**.

stages:
  - deploy

variables:
  INSTITUTE_NAME: "Pathnex"
  ENVIRONMENT: "dev"

deploy:
  stage: deploy
  image: alpine:latest
  script:
    - echo "Deploying to $ENVIRONMENT by $INSTITUTE_NAME"




